WEBVTT

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
I'm 74. Diabetes, presión alta, the whole package.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.500
Mi plan de Medicare Advantage covers my medicines, el eye doctor, hasta la transportación a la clínica.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.500
My sister in Orlando pays more y le dan menos.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.500
My dad is 86. A nurse from his plan comes to the house every month.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.500
She checks his blood pressure, his feet, his pills.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:45.500
Three years without going to the hospital. That's the outcome.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.500
96% of our seniors are on Medicare Advantage, and Washington pays us 41% less.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.700
In our pharmacies, we make sure patients stay adherent to their therapies, and we work hand in hand with the doctors.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:01:05.000
The Healthcare Paradox. How Puerto Rico navigates the system.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.000
New episodes weekly, wherever you get your podcasts.
